{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.poster.avif?t=1761190041\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.webm?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.mp4?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude78 HOW FAR CAN YOU GET BEFORE THE CRASH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong> blends <strong>3D side-scroller action</strong> and <strong>turn-based combat</strong> in a survival experience focused on crafting, strategy, and progression.<br>Face endless waves of enemies, gather minerals and gold, craft weapons and metal allies, and survive as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd29 3D SURVIVAL RUNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins in a 3D side-scrolling arena.<br>Defeat enemies, <strong>collect minerals and gold</strong>, <strong>buy power-ups</strong> with gold during the run, and <strong>gain experience</strong> to <strong>level up</strong>, <strong>unlock new abilities</strong>, and <strong>access new maps</strong>.<br>Every <strong>5 minutes</strong>, a <strong>boss portal</strong> becomes available; if <strong>4 minutes</strong> pass without activating it, the <strong>Final Swarm</strong> will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2092e61c0ca9e82d4fd919f72430a73a.poster.avif?t=1761190041\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2092e61c0ca9e82d4fd919f72430a73a.webm?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2092e61c0ca9e82d4fd919f72430a73a.mp4?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 METAL ALLIES AND CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>minerals</strong> to <strong>craft metal allies</strong> (units that fight alongside you in real time) and <strong>weapons</strong> for your run setup.<br>You can also <strong>capture enemies</strong> in turn-based battles and <strong>use them directly as allies</strong> in survival mode.<br>Combine different types of weapons and allies to create more effective strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/aa8e5b661da61c09359c8e8fc2deb986.poster.avif?t=1761190041\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/aa8e5b661da61c09359c8e8fc2deb986.webm?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/aa8e5b661da61c09359c8e8fc2deb986.mp4?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd01 TURN-BASED BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>lobby</strong>, <strong>all NPCs before the survival portals</strong> can be challenged in <strong>turn-based battles</strong>.<br>Defeat them to <strong>capture enemies</strong> and add them to your list of summonable allies during 3D side-scroller runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2c729ac994dd266cca92f20fbf58e34d.poster.avif?t=1761190041\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2c729ac994dd266cca92f20fbf58e34d.webm?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/2c729ac994dd266cca92f20fbf58e34d.mp4?t=1761190041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Hybrid gameplay: <strong>3D side-scroller + turn-based battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f <strong>Crafting</strong> of <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>metal allies</strong> using minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Power-ups</strong> purchased with <strong>gold</strong> during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Boss portal</strong> every 5 minutes; <strong>Final Swarm</strong> after 4 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Level up</strong> to unlock <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>new maps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Persistent progression: <strong>level</strong>, <strong>minerals</strong>, and <strong>metal allies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Highly replayable runs</strong> with progressive difficulty</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411880?t=1761190041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411880?t=1761190041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/a907722e48d0e62969aff09e8e316a013bc96813/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761190041","capsule_imagev5":"https